      "text": "# Graph Traversal — BFS, DFS, and Their Decorations"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-TRAVERSAL.md#001",
      "path": [
        "02-TRAVERSAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
