        "title": "Graph Traversal",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "Traversal is *the* primitive. Almost every algorithm in this directory is a BFS\nor DFS with extra bookkeeping bolted on: shortest paths is BFS/Dijkstra with a\npriority queue, topological sort is DFS with a finish-time stack, SCCs are DFS\nwith low-link numbers, cycle detection is DFS with a color array. Master the two\nwalks and the bookkeeping, and the rest of the field is variations."
    },
    {
      "id": "02-TRAVERSAL.md#002",
      "path": [
        "02-TRAVERSAL.md"
      ],
      "level": 0,
      "line": 1,
