      "text": "s                                s\n      / | \\                            / | \\\n     1  1  1   <- layer 1             a  .  .     dive a, then a's child,\n    /|     |\\                         |          then backtrack, then next\n   2 2     2 2 <- layer 2             b          ...\n                                      |\n   gives FEWEST-EDGES paths          c          gives a DFS TREE + edge types"
