        "source_custody": "partial",
        "status": "source-custody",
        "title": "Graph Traversal",
        "updated": "null"
      },
      "text": "```\n  WHITE = undiscovered     GRAY = on the recursion stack (being explored)\n  BLACK = fully finished (subtree done)"
    },
    {
      "id": "02-TRAVERSAL.md#024",
      "path": [
